        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: A to Z\n- People: Ben Queen, Rashida Jones, Will McCormack, Lenora Crichlow\n- Companies: Warner Bros., NBC, ABC\n- Roles: executive producer\n- Topics: romantic comedy television series, television casting and recognition\n\nFacts:\n- A to Z is an American romantic comedy television series created by Ben Queen.\n- Ben Queen served as an executive producer of A to Z with Rashida Jones and Will McCormack for Warner Bros.\n- Rashida Jones is widely known for playing Ann Perkins on NBC's comedy Parks and Recreation, for which she received acclaim.\n- Lenora Crichlow later had regular roles in the ABC sitcom Back in the Game and the NBC comedy series A to Z.",
